Pretext exposes segLevels in PreparedTextWithSegments, enabling consumers to build bidi-aware coordinate maps. However, the underlying segment widths come from canvas.measureText(segment) on isolated segments. For Arabic script the browser's DOM renderer may produce different effective widths due to contextual shaping, directional spacing, or font-level bidi adjustments.

